    {
      "id": 62018,
      "category": "team",
      "content": "Due to one of the exported activities(com.linecorp.linelite.ui.android.share.SelectShareActivity) of LINE Lite client for Android before 2.17.0 not verifying the URI sent by a third-party application installed on the user device, the application with some interaction of the user would be able to retrieve private files within the LINE Lite client for Android to be copied to the publicly accessible directory.",
